* Oracle
** Two-stage median
*** Per validator: weighted median of\n8 spot venues, weights 3/2/2/1/1/1/1/1
*** Network: stake-weighted median\nof validator submissions
*** Published every 3 seconds
*** Asset-specific inclusion rules
** Mark price
*** Median of three indices
**** Oracle + 150 s EMA of basis
**** Median of bid, ask, last trade
**** Weighted median of 5 CEX perp mids
*** Fourth candidate when only two exist
*** EMA is a ratio, tau = 2.5 min
left side
** Who uses which price
*** Funding: oracle, for the premium\nand the notional conversion
*** Margin, liquidation, TP/SL,\nunrealised PnL: mark
*** Premium: impact prices from the book
*** Portfolio margin: borrow oracle price
*** Delisting: 1 h TWAP spot oracle
*** Order rejection: too far from oracle
** Assets with no external price
*** Hyperps: 8 h EWMA of own marks
*** Oracle capped at 4x initial mark
*** Mark capped at 3x the 8 h EMA
*** Premium samples at 1% of normal
** HIP-3: deployer as oracle
*** setOracle, oracleUpdater
*** Funding multiplier, interest rate
*** externalPerpPx 50% daily review
*** Slashable, stake burned
** From the HyperEVM
*** Read precompile at 0x...0807
*** Matches Core state at block build
*** Divide by 10^(6 - szDecimals)
*** Or third-party feeds on the EVM
